40
00:04:32,740 --> 00:04:37,540
The answer, if you're being honest with yourself, is that there is no difference at all.

41
00:04:37,700 --> 00:04:41,580
Much of the manifesto of the would-be assassin is indistinguishable

42
00:04:41,780 --> 00:04:44,720
