54
00:05:44,980 --> 00:05:46,380
It has to stop.

55
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:47,740
And one more point.

56
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:54,380
Saturday night served as yet another reminder of how important it is to fund the Department of Homeland Security.

57
00:05:54,480 --> 00:06:02,080
It is shameful that the United States Congress has kept this vital agency defunded for 73 days,

58
