74
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:46,260
This is a national emergency, and every member of Congress needs to put their country over party

75
00:07:46,520 --> 00:07:49,340
and get the Department of Homeland Security funded.

76
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:51,620
